tag\" ><strong>Rich and diverse playthroughs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470630/extras/f26adc3457978a475b0059561e017a6d.poster.avif?t=1729001214\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470630/extras/f26adc3457978a475b0059561e017a6d.webm?t=1729001214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-changing tactics</strong>: Choose your targets wisely and set your priorities right. Should you take care first of the gunslinger threatening you with two guns, or pick up this tantalizing bag of dollars?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lots of interactive items</strong>: Take advantage of opportunities offered by background objects (gong that stuns your foes, horseshoe making the bullets ricochet around\u2026).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural environment</strong>: Learn to adapt to a procedurally generated architecture. Watch out for foes taking cover behind a window, or aiming at you from a balcony!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shoot, laugh, and be open to surprises</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pervading humour</strong>: Be ready to laugh out loud when you see hats taking flight or cow-boys dancing to a piano tune!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy cartoonish world</strong>: Come and discover the many surprises that the Wild West of Bullet Town has in store for you!</p></li></ul>",
